  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3601.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3601.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is for the establishment and operation of a toll-free hotline for reporting information on drug activity within drug-free school zones.\n\nSource. #5382, eff 4-21-92; ss by #6703, eff 3-3-98; ss by #8553, eff 1-26-06; ss by #10591, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14008, eff 6-25-24",
